commit 5a69da3cc07a35512d3e3e3d833e4ef802ff9c0a
Author: hui-ya.chuang@noaa.gov <hui-ya.chuang@noaa.gov>
Date:   Mon Feb 9 20:14:12 2015 +0000

    Post source code was modified to accommodate different
    versions of Ferrier's schemes.  Minor fix was made to
    CALTAU.f to present division by zeros.
    
    Post regression test results are not changed.
    
    Per communication with DTC, WRF will change meta data
    mp_physics from 5 to 95 after Spring 2015 release.
    The Ferrier-Aligo is being incorporated to WRF and will
    use mp_physics=5 .
    
    Per communication with Brad, these changes will assume
    the following:
    1. MP=5 is for F-A and is run for all cores.
    2. MP=85 is still around and supports settings consistent
     with the current HWRF.
    3. MP=95 and gridtype="B" uses settings in the 'fer' microphysics
     option for the NMMB (similar to etampold in WRF, which is the
     current MP=95). MP=95 for other cores (ARW & WRF NMM),
     which uses etampnew settings (currently MP=5).
    
    
